red by the issuance of the Securities; and (F) neither the Company nor any Subsidiary has any stock appreciation rights or &#8220;phantom stock&#8221;&nbsp;plans or agreements or any similar plan or agreement. The Company may adopt an equity incentive plan following the date of this Agreement.</p>
