			</td>
			<td style="vertical-align:top;">
			<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;"><u>Other Preferred Shares; Variable Securities</u>.</p>
			</td>
