			<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify;">The obligation of the Company hereunder to issue and sell the Preferred Shares to the Buyer at the Closing is subject to the satisfaction, at or before the Closing Date, of each of the following conditions, provided that these conditions are for the Company&#8217;s sole benefit and may be waived by the Company at any time in its sole discretion by providing the Buyer with prior written notice thereof:&nbsp;</p>
